s.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-lj[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-lj/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob bank report -c child-period aggregate[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]report[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]report: share the periods calendar's child partition, then add an opt-in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`-c/--charts` aggregate to `bob bank report` with per-bucket money, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage states, targets, group totals, folded categories, tests, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the JSON contract docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Charts decoder and pure panel model[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]model: strictly decode `charts` in bob-ledger-tools, add the `-c` fetch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]spec and older-bob detection, and build the pure panel model (states, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]encodings, formats, copy, accessibility text) with vector tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Panel painter, styles, and previews[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]paint[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]paint: render the model into the read-only panel DOM with stats-strip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]styling, container-query layout, keyboard and table twins, a Chromium [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview harness, and DOM tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Period host lifecycle, gate, and navigation[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]hosts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after report, paint[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]hosts: mount the third sibling host in every period `bob-stats-strip` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fence behind `stats.bank_period`, subscribe on visibility, navigate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without writing, capture real bob JSON fixtures, and deploy.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bank Period Charts docs and vocabulary[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after hosts[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the behavior contract and config in bob-cli and plugin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, apply only the accepted memory decisions, and record follow-up [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proposals.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-lj","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-lj.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-lj.1"},"source_run_id":"run-cc6633b51f48472c7135d9c51730c69a","started_at":"2026-11-14T14:41:57.607907+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"5dd3aed451a2bc28ec67ef9a84a946898975b0d75aed62b1bdb51bcc781ec93e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lj.3/chat.md","size_bytes":4691},"commits":{"digest":"35fced8a8233d2a506edad283686ad8b445b42ede95afd1a8a6cc54527c3db4c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lj.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lj.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"9198828c2206a173bf68cac6004d9fd92a466130af